  "title": "Vegan Blueberry and Banana Oatmeal Muffins",
  "description": "Perfect for snacking, these vegan muffins are made with almond milk, banana, and blueberries, and use rolled oats instead of flour.",
  "authors": [
    "Salvatore Tuozzola"
